                  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"feature item\">\n                            <span class=\"text-sm font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"feature text\">\n                                ورش تطبيقية للمهندسين\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"text-xs text-white/50\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"feature index\">\n                                02\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-2-3\" data-name=\"feature item\">\n                            <span class=\"text-sm font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"feature text\">\n                                مدربون وخبراء متخصصون\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"text-xs text-white/50\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2-2-3-2\" data-name=\"feature index\">\n                                03\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </article>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"relative isolate overflow-hidden bg-[#0e3030] py-20 text-white lg:py-28\" data-kid=\"1-5\" data-name=\"membership call to action section\">\n        <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute -end-[150px] -top-[230px] h-[620px] w-[620px] opacity-20\" data-kid=\"1-5-1\" data-name=\"decorative circle container\">\n            <svg class=\"h-full w-full\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-1\" data-name=\"svg\" viewbox=\"0 0 620 620\">\n                <circle class=\"seal-ring-slow\" cx=\"310\" cy=\"310\" fill=\"none\" r=\"280\" stroke=\"#c9d7ff\" stroke-width=\"1\">\n                </circle>\n                <circle cx=\"310\" cy=\"310\" fill=\"none\" r=\"220\" stroke=\"#c9d7ff\" stroke-width=\"1\">\n                </circle>\n                <circle cx=\"310\" cy=\"310\" fill=\"none\" r=\"160\" stroke=\"#c9d7ff\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 15\" stroke-width=\"1\">\n                </circle>\n            </svg>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"relative mx-auto flex max-w-[920px] flex-col items-start gap-8 px-6 lg:px-10\" data-kid=\"1-5-2\" data-name=\"content wrapper\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.14em] text-[#b9caff]\" data-kid=\"1-5-2-1\" data-name=\"eyebrow\">\n                عضوية جمعية المهندسين البحرينية\n            </p>\n            <h2 class=\"max-w-3xl text-4xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-[-0.04em] lg:text-6xl\" data-kid=\"1-5-2-2\" data-name=\"headline\">\n                اجعل مهنتك جزءًا\n                <br data-kid=\"1-5-2-2-1\" data-name=\"line break\"/>\n                من أثر أكبر.\n            </h2>\n            <p class=\"max-w-2xl text-lg leading-9 text-white/72\" data-kid=\"1-5-2-3\" data-name=\"description\">\n                انضم إلى شبكة مهنية تجمع الخبرة، التعلم، والفرص — وتشارك في بناء مستقبل الهندسة في البحرين.\n            </p>\n            <a class=\"inline-flex min-h-12 items-center gap-3 rounded-md bg-white px-6 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-[#0e3030] transition-colors hover:bg-[#d8e2ff] focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-white\" data-kid=\"1-5-2-4\" data-name=\"call to action button\" href=\"#pulse\">\n                تعرّف على مزايا العضوية\n                <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-lg leading-none\" data-kid=\"1-5-2-4-1\" data-name=\"arrow icon\">\n                    ←\n                </span>\n            </a>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n    <footer class=\"bg-[#11182d] text-white\" data-kid=\"1-6\" data-name=\"footer bar\">\n        <div class=\"mx-auto flex max-w-[1180px] flex-col gap-7 px-6 py-10 lg:flex-row lg:items-center lg:justify-between lg:px-10\" data-kid=\"1-6-1\" data-name=\"footer container\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-1\" data-name=\"logo area\">\n                <img alt=\"شعار جمعية المهندسين البحرينية\" class=\"h-11 w-11 rounded-full bg-white p-1 object-contain\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-1-1\" data-name=\"logo image\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/api/local/images/src/assets/bse-logo.png\"/>\n                <div data-kid=\"1-6-1-1-2\" data-name=\"footer organisation text\">\n                    <p class=\"text-sm font-bold\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"organisation name\">\n                        جمعية المهندسين البحرينية\n                    </p>\n                    <p class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-white/45\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"foundation year text\">\n                        منذ عام 1972 · مملكة البحرين\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-x-7 gap-y-3 text-sm text-white/55\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-2\" data-name=\"footer navigation links\">\n                <span data-kid=\"1-6-1-2-1\" data-name=\"nav link one\">\n                    من نحن\n                </span>\n                <span data-kid=\"1-6-1-2-2\" data-name=\"nav link two\">\n                    الفعاليات\n                </span>\n                <span data-kid=\"1-6-1-2-3\" data-name=\"nav link three\">\n                    مركز التدريب\n                </span>\n                <span data-kid=\"1-6-1-2-4\" data-name=\"nav link four\">\n                    تواصل معنا\n                </span>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"text-xs text-white/35\" data-kid=\"1-6-1-3\" data-name=\"copyright notice\">\n                © 2026 BSE\n            </p>\n        </div>\n    </footer>\n</div>\n",
